| A: skived P core, 1 mm Cu (<= 33 um) | 187 | 53.4 | 39.4 | 84 C | 45.4 (90 C), In 0.032 |
| ECAM 0.15 fins near ceiling (B2), 1 mm Cu | 132 | 61.2 | 47.2 | 92 C | 53.1 (98 C), In 0.032 |
| X-R: ECAM 0.15 fins on 1 mm Cu-diamond | 125 | 60.2 | 46.2 | 91 C | 44.8 (90 C), In 0.011 |
| X: ECAM 0.10 fins on 1 mm Cu-diamond (<= 33 um) | 184 | 51.2 | 37.2 | 82 C | 35.8 (81 C), In 0.011 |
| P core on 1 mm CuW (CTE-matched, conventional) | 187 | 62.9 | 48.9 | 94 C | 47.8 (93 C), In 0.012 |
| P core on 1 mm MoCu (CTE-matched, conventional) | 187 | 60.4 | 46.4 | 91 C | 45.3 (90 C), In 0.012 |
| P core + 0.5 mm CVD diamond insert + 0.5 mm Cu (braze 0.005) | 187 | 51.9 | 37.9 | 83 C | 43.8 (89 C), In 0.032 |
| Vapor-chamber base (0.08 cm2K/W), P core | 187 | 77.8 | 63.8 | 109 C | 69.8 (115 C), In 0.032 |
| Reference: bare-die LM on 0.8 mm Cu pedestal (sibling Tier 3A), R / P core | 127 / 187 | - | 46.5 / 37.6 (die top) | 92 / 83 C | - |
| X as built: segmented 2 mm ECAM strips on Cu-diamond, CuMo cap (<= 33 um) | 172 | - | - | - | 37.1 (82 C), In 0.011 |

Notes: fit valid for 1 mm bases and h_eff 100-350 kW/m2K; base re-based 1-D (die 26x33 mm >> spreading length 1.8-4 mm, so lateral spreading credit is negligible). CVD/VC rows include their interfaces.

