## 10. Power-electronics check: SiC module baseplate area 30-80 W/cm2, 50/50 WEG at 65 C, 10 LPM per module
- forged pin-fin class (coarse 1.0/1.0 x 6 mm, 40 mm path): plate R'' 0.835 cm2K/W (incl. caloric), conv 35.4 K, base 3.8 K, avg dT 41.7 K at 50 W/cm2, dP 3.5 kPa
- chassis de-rated 0.40/0.30 x 3 mm, 4 mm cells, Cu: plate R'' 0.417 cm2K/W (incl. caloric), conv 14.4 K, base 3.8 K, avg dT 20.9 K at 50 W/cm2, dP 1.8 kPa
- L-PBF AlSi10Mg conformal 0.5/0.5 x 4 mm, 4 mm cells (k 150): plate R'' 0.691 cm2K/W (incl. caloric), conv 22.0 K, base 10.0 K, avg dT 34.6 K at 50 W/cm2, dP 1.8 kPa
